  consumes InformationPolicy
  publishes LatentWatch
  node_types LatentProfile
  node_types EmbeddingProjection
  node_types LatentSpacePassport
  edge_types projected_from
  edge_types comparable_under
  edge_types follows
  invariant every projection names an exact semantic subject, feature closure, causal frontier and source digest
  invariant cross-space comparison requires an explicit comparability contract
  forbidden_inference similarity -> identity, relation, evidence, authority, or financial truth
  forbidden_inference latent drift -> causal change
  interacts latent-coordinate-narrows-derivation
