architecture model-representation-graph
  canonical_name ModelRepresentationGraph
  family model
  domain Model / Representation
  layer model/representation
  semantic_question What representation profile is this model in, and what invalidates it?
  purpose Binds model identity, representation profile, prepared state, execution phenotype, runtime capability with separate invalidation domains, so changing one does not silently invalidate another. FPQ is representation, never identity.
  maturity architectural
